  <p id="c-nanqishu-040-zijian:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">湘東王<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zijian:p001:m0003" ref="kix_r92_2ed_O">子建</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zijian:p001:m0006" ref="kix_r92_2ed_O">雲立</persName>，世祖第二十一子也。母<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zijian:p001:m0019" ref="jj4_k1e_5rf">謝氏</persName>，無寵，世祖度爲尼。高宗卽位，使還母。<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zijian:p001:m0040" ref="kix_r92_2ed_O">子建</persName>永泰元年見殺，年十三。</p>
</text>
